  "url": "https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/",
  "type": "history",
  "slug": "the-beatles-final-photo-session",
  "title": "22 August 1969: The Beatles' final photo shoot",
  "date": "1969-08-22",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></span> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/2/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/3/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">3</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/4/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">4</span></a></div><p>The Beatles united for a final photographic session on 22 August 1969. It was also the last occasion in which all four members were together for band duties; thereafter their only meetings were business-related. <span id=\"more-3251\"></span></p><blockquote><div>It was just a photo session. I wasn’t there thinking, ‘OK, this is the last photo session.’</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\"><a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo Starr</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/anthologypb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Anthology</em></a></div><p><a href=\"/gallery/releases/hey_jude_lp/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-9474\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"9474\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/hey_jude_lp/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/hey_jude_lp.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"762,762\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"3\" data-image-title=\"Hey Jude album artwork\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/hey_jude_lp.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/hey_jude_lp-200x200.jpg\" alt=\"Hey Jude album artwork\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"alignright size-thumbnail wp-image-9474\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/hey_jude_lp-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/hey_jude_lp-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/hey_jude_lp-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/hey_jude_lp.jpg 762w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"></a>The shoot took place in the house and grounds of Tittenhurst Park, <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> and <a href=\"/people/yoko-ono/\">Yoko Ono</a>’s home in Sunninghill near Ascot, Berkshire. The couple had moved in earlier in the month on <a href=\"/1969/08/11/john-lennon-yoko-ono-move-into-tittenhurst-park/\">11 August</a>, although they had bought the 72-acre estate on <a href=\"/1969/05/04/john-lennon-yoko-ono-buy-tittenhurst-park/\">4 May 1969</a>.</p><p>The photo shoot took place two days after their <a href=\"/1969/08/20/mixing-editing-i-want-you-shes-so-heavy/\">final recording session</a> together. The photographers were Ethan Russell and Monte Fresco, with additional pictures taken by The Beatles’ assistant <a href=\"/people/mal-evans/\">Mal Evans</a>. Some low-quality film footage was also shot, some of which is thought to have been shown on the BBC Two arts programme <em>Late Night Line-Up</em> on 19 September 1969, during an <a href=\"/albums/abbey-road/\"><em>Abbey Road</em></a> special.</p><blockquote><div>Linda shot some 16mm footage on my camera. That turned out to be the last film taken.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\"><a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/anthologypb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Anthology</em></a></div><p>Yoko Ono and a heavily pregnant <a href=\"/people/linda-mccartney/\">Linda McCartney</a> appeared in some of the photographs. Also at the shoot were Apple Corps’ press officer <a href=\"/people/derek-taylor/\">Derek Taylor</a> and Paul McCartney’s sheepdog Martha.</p><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/OTD?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#OTD</a> 1969 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/TheBeatles?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#TheBeatles</a> turned up at Tittenhurst Park (John's house in Ascot) for what turned out to be their last photo shoot together <a href=\"https://t.co/G4CHcqP8ic\">pic.twitter.com/G4CHcqP8ic</a></p><p>— The Beatles (@thebeatles) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/thebeatles/status/900010090819756037?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">August 22, 2017</a></p></blockquote><p></p><p>A number of photographs were taking in various locations in the house and around the estate. Lennon and <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a> wore wide-brimmed hats in some of the pictures.</p><p>The session began in front of the main house, with The Beatles standing by the pillars underneath the terrace canopy.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-3251 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNDUiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTQ1IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"145\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_01-145x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John Lennon, Yoko Ono and George Harrison at The Beatles' final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_01-145x200.jpg 145w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_01-421x580.jpg 421w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_01.jpg 580w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 145px) 100vw, 145px\" data-attachment-id=\"8972\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"580,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon, Yoko Ono and George Harrison at The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_01.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTMzIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzMyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"133\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_02-200x133.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John Lennon and Yoko Ono at The Beatles' final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_02-200x133.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_02-580x385.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_02.jpg 640w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"8973\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"640,425\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon and Yoko Ono at The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_02.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_03/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNDkiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTQ5IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"149\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_03-149x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul and Linda McCartney, John Lennon and Yoko Ono at The Beatles' final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_03-149x200.jpg 149w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_03-431x580.jpg 431w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_03.jpg 601w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 149px) 100vw, 149px\" data-attachment-id=\"8974\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"601,808\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul and Linda McCartney, John Lennon and Yoko Ono at The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_03.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_04/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMzUiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTM1IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"135\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_04-135x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John Lennon and Yoko Ono at The Beatles' final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_04-135x200.jpg 135w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_04-391x580.jpg 391w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_04.jpg 424w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 135px) 100vw, 135px\" data-attachment-id=\"8975\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"424,629\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon and Yoko Ono at The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_04.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_07/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzNyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"137\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_07-200x137.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Yoko Ono and Linda McCartney at The Beatles' final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_07-200x137.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_07-580x397.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_07.jpg 720w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"8978\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_07/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_07.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"720,493\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yoko Ono and Linda McCartney at The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_07.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>From the main house The Beatles walked down the main garden path past the statue of Diana, goddess of the hunt.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-2\" class=\"gallery galleryid-3251 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_05/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNDMiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTQzIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"143\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_05-143x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles' final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_05-143x200.jpg 143w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_05-414x580.jpg 414w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_05.jpg 457w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 143px) 100vw, 143px\" data-attachment-id=\"8976\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_05/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_05.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"457,640\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_05.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_06/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM1IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzNSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"135\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_06-200x135.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles' final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_par